SUMMARY:Richard O'Brien's The Rocky Horror Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261031T223000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261101T003000
UID:bat-202610312230-richard-o-brien-s-the-rocky-horror-show@bloomingtonar
 ts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. In this cult classic\, sweethearts Brad and Janet get stuck
  in a storm and discover the eerie mansion of Dr. Frank-N-Furter. Elaborat
 e dance numbers and rock songs reveal Frank-N-Furter’s latest creation: 
 a muscular man named “Rocky.”
LOCATION:Ruth N. Halls Theatre
URL:https://theatre.indiana.edu/on-stage/productions/2026-2027/the_rocky_h
 orror_show.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
