BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Do You Feel Anger?
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261112T213000
UID:bat-202611121930-do-you-feel-anger-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Sofia is hired as an empathy coach at a debt collection age
 ncy where employees can barely identify emotions. As they stumble towards 
 enlightenment\, someone keeps mugging Eva in the kitchen. An outrageous co
 medy about a world where some people’s feelings matter more than others
 ’.
LOCATION:Wells-Metz Theatre
URL:https://theatre.indiana.edu/on-stage/productions/2026-2027/do_you_feel
 _anger.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
