DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T213000
UID:bat-202611141930-idomeneo@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. After King Idomeneo returns to Crete from the Trojan War\, 
 the high-stakes consequences of a desperate deal he struck with Neptune fo
 r safe passage reveal themselves when he must choose between his own son a
 nd the vow he made to the sea god. Mozart’s first mature opera.
LOCATION:IU Musical Arts Center
URL:https://operaballet.indiana.edu/events/idomeneo.html
