DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T213000
UID:bat-202611141930-do-you-feel-anger-@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Sofia is hired as an empathy coach at a debt collection age
 ncy where employees can barely identify emotions. As they stumble towards 
 enlightenment\, someone keeps mugging Eva in the kitchen. An outrageous co
 medy about a world where some people’s feelings matter more than others
 ’.
