BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nurse Blake But Did You Die? Comedy Tour
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T210000
UID:bat-202611191900-nurse-blake-but-did-you-die-comedy-tour@bloomingtonar
 ts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Nurse Blake is back with his hilarious comedy tour with all
  new content\, diving into the wildest things patients and their families 
 say and do. From self-diagnosing Stage 8 Cancer with WebMD to hitting the 
 call light like they are on a game show\, nothing is off-limits!\n\nExpect
  a night of nonstop laughter packed with healthcare workers who desperatel
 y need a break. Bring your friends\, coworkers\, and even that one patient
  who swore they were allergic to water—this is going to be a night to re
 member!\n\n18+ show. Nurse-medical professional style of comedy.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/nurse-blake-but-did-you-die-comedy-t
 our-november-19-2026
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
